      374.17,
      539.89,
      421.24
    ],
    "text": "IN terms of regulations \u201c3\u201d of the regulations formed under the Pilgrimage Ordinance (Chapter 175) and Public in theGovernment Gazette No. 10630 of 8th January 1954. It is hereby notified that annual Pilgrimage of Godapitiya PoruwaiMosque \u201cMuhiyadeen Muslim Mosque\u201d at Godapitiya, Akuressa in Athuraliya Divisional Secretariat in Matara District,will commence on 20th December and terminate 31st December 2017.",
