      434.17,
      539.9,
      469.24
    ],
    "text": "The regulations relating this Pilgrimage Ordinance in Government Gazette No. 10630 of 8th January 1954, shallin force within the camp above referred to in the regulations and described in the schedule thereto during the period of thePilgrimage referred to above.",
